; cities (docs/ART.md 9): one sprite per style and size tier, city/<style>_<tier>.
; Dark masses lit from the upper left (lit edge 5, shade 3/2, void outline), windows in amber l
; (remapped to the style's light by the renderer), at most one L core per building; the stone next
; to a window is pre-lit through the style's pool table. Base on the bottom row (tile row 30).
; `: finial` is where a capital's finial goes (the top of the tallest spire).
; Tiers: I 1-3, II 4-7, III 8-12, IV 13-19, V 20+ (footprints 16x12 .. 32x28).

